WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In a rapid stream of symbols, two letters appear.
You catch the first. Did you see the second?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Experiments show that reporting the second can
become harder a few hundred milliseconds later.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A long meditation-retreat study found a change
in this effect. It did not test a commercial recording.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
If you're comparing meditation audio, ask
what's in the program and what's actually tested.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Start with the free Focus Fieldbook.
Read the independent guide before deciding.
